# Log-triage — hilog ArkTS panic with V8-style stack frames
#
# Exercises PR-A LangArkTS path. The log contains a hilog header line
# followed by a JS-style ArkTS stack trace pointing at .ets files
# under entry/src/main/ets/. The log_triager should:
#   - identify lang=arkts (or javascript/typescript as Tier-2 fallback)
#   - emit Errors[].Frames[] with file=entry/src/main/ets/pages/...ets
#   - mark IntentHint=RootCause (any frame.line>0)
#
# hilog format reference: openharmony/hiviewdfx_hilog README.md
#   MM-DD HH:MM:SS.mmm PID TID LEVEL DOMAIN/TAG: MESSAGE
#
# Ground truth: synthetic log against codrax repo; ArkTS frame paths
# do not exist in-repo, so the system's os.Stat gate will drop them
# but the LLM should still extract the error type as an Entity.
ID="hilog_arkts_panic"
NAME="log-triage hilog ArkTS panic + V8 stack"
QUESTION="这个 ArkTS 应用崩溃日志显示什么问题？指出根因。"
LOG='04-15 14:32:18.421 5821 5821 E A0c0d/JsApp: TypeError: Cannot read property "name" of undefined
04-15 14:32:18.421 5821 5821 E A0c0d/JsApp:     at UserCard.build (entry/src/main/ets/components/UserCard.ets:42:15)
04-15 14:32:18.421 5821 5821 E A0c0d/JsApp:     at UserCard.__updateChildElement (entry/src/main/ets/components/UserCard.ets:38:5)
04-15 14:32:18.421 5821 5821 E A0c0d/JsApp:     at IndexPage.build (entry/src/main/ets/pages/Index.ets:128:9)
04-15 14:32:18.421 5821 5821 E A0c0d/JsApp:     at IndexPage.__updateRoot (entry/src/main/ets/pages/Index.ets:120:3)
04-15 14:32:18.421 5821 5821 E A0c0d/JsApp:     at __ELEMENT_invoke (native)
04-15 14:32:18.422 5821 5821 F A0c0d/JsApp: Application crashed; pid=5821 sig=6
'
EXPECT_CONTAINS="TypeError"
EXPECT_SECTIONS="UserCard"
